<head>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/technical-styles/agent-prompt.css">
    <script type="application/json" id="homeDiscoverData">{"baseUrl":"{{baseUrl}}"}</script>
    <script src="/technical-scripts/home-discover.js" defer></script>
    {{!-- Drives the hero's constellation backdrop. Served from our own origin rather than
          upstream's jsDelivr URL: that path is minified by jsDelivr on the fly ("Do NOT
          use SRI with dynamically generated files", says the file's own banner), so its
          bytes move whenever they bump Terser and the pinned hash stops matching. It had
          already rotted - a cold fetch failed the integrity check and the browser refused
          to run it, so anyone without it warm in cache (an incognito window, a first-time
          visitor) silently lost the animation. Local and same-origin, there is nothing to
          rot and no third-party fetch. --}}
    <script src="/technical-scripts/particles.js" defer></script>
</head>
<main>
    {{> header profile=profile baseUrl=baseUrl devportalMode=devportalMode showApiWorkflowsNav=showApiWorkflowsNav }}
    {{> sidebar profile=profile baseUrl=baseUrl devportalMode=devportalMode showApiWorkflowsNav=showApiWorkflowsNav}}
    {{> home showApiWorkflowsNav=showApiWorkflowsNav}}
</main>
